# Regulatory assessment — kept LOCAL, never published (owner, 2026-08-16).
# Its §5.2 records the manufacturer's own health information to explain two design decisions, and
# §7.1 of the same document forbids that fact appearing in published material. The repo went public
# so GitHub Pages could serve the privacy policy, which made the file world-readable.
# The document itself is unchanged and still the signable manufacturer's assessment — it simply
# lives on disk only. Note: it remains in commits made before this date.
docs/regulatory-qualification-assessment.md
docs/regulatory-qualification-assessment.pdf

